Size of various types used in R (in bytes):

sizeof(bool): 1
sizeof(char): 1
sizeof(Rboolean): 4
sizeof(int): 4
sizeof(unsigned): 4
sizeof(R_len_t): 4
sizeof(size_t): 8
sizeof(R_xlen_t): 8
sizeof(double): 8
sizeof(Rcomplex): 16
sizeof(Complex): 16
sizeof(RObject*): 8
sizeof(GCNode): 32
sizeof(RObject): 40
sizeof(VectorBase): 40
sizeof(ConsCell): 64
sizeof(PairList): 64
sizeof(Expression): 64
sizeof(Environment): 64
sizeof(Closure): 64
sizeof(Promise): 64
sizeof(Symbol): 64
sizeof(IntVector): 64
sizeof(ListVector): 64
sizeof(RealVector): 64
